            "description": "These 3D purely mechanical models of subduction were designed to investigate how ribbon collision perturbs the strain and stress field at the surface, the slab interior, and intraplate force balance. The models examined how the slab responded to ribbons colliding at different orientations. We determined two styles of intra-slab deformation triggered by non-orthogonal and orthogonal ribbon collision.",
